[
  {
    "kind": "deflection",
    "pattern": "Never mind!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I’ll eat it,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps it doesn’t understand English,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, perhaps not,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, perhaps you haven’t found it so yet,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, perhaps your feelings may be different,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I’ve tried to say “How doth the little busy bee,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, be off, then!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But perhaps he can’t help it,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I suppose so,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, then,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Yes, but some crumbs must have got in as well,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I dare say you never even spoke to Time!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps not,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Not at first, perhaps,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I’d hardly finished the first verse,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Then you keep moving round, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You can draw water out of a water-well,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But they were _in_ the well,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, it must be removed,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps it hasn’t one,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I dare say you’re wondering why I don’t put my arm round your waist,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You know what to beautify is, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, there was Mystery,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I can’t show it you myself,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "and perhaps you were never even introduced to a lobster—",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe so,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "They’re done with blacking, I believe.",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I mean what I say,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I never heard it before,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I suppose they are the jurors.",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, at any rate, the Dormouse said—",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, if I must, I must,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "_Un_important, of course, I meant,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I shan’t go, at any rate,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "Talking of axes,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Not _quite_ right, I’m afraid,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I—I’m a little girl,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "There’s no sort of use in knocking,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "What sort of people live about here?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I’d rather not,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "The game’s going on rather better now,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I quite agree with you,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "if I had it written down: but I can’t quite follow it as you say it.",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "A cheap sort of present!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "What sort of a dance is it?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Would you like to see a little of it?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Will you walk a little faster?",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I’d rather finish my tea,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "self_interruption",
    "pattern": "Oh, I beg your pardon!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "self_interruption",
    "pattern": "I beg your pardon!",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "self_interruption",
    "pattern": "I beg your pardon,",
    "source_book": "11",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "deflection",
    "pattern": "I wish I could forget it,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "deflection",
    "pattern": "Well, never mind that now,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "What for? Are you hurt? Have you seen something?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, who am I?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, well! who knows what may happen?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, Jane Eyre, and are you a good child?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I can perhaps get her to talk.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, then, with Miss Temple you are good?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, Helen?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I meant to give each of you some of this to take with you,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But where are you going to, Helen? Can you see? Do you know?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe; I have faith: I am going to God.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, who is it?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Georgiana is handsome, I suppose, Bessie?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, and what of John Reed?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I dare say you are clever, though,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "This will be your luggage, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I suppose,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Mrs. Fairfax, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Your morning school-hours are over now, I suppose,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Yes—‘after life’s fitful fever they sleep well,’",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Nor ever had, I suppose: do you remember them?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Have you seen much society?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, is he?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps he thinks it gloomy.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Ah! well, come forward; be seated here.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "The smile is very well,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, leave me:",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Mr. Rochester is not likely to return soon, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, John",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I suppose, now,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I am very well, sir.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I did not wish to disturb you, as you seemed engaged, sir.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You see now, my queenly Blanche,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, Blanche?",
