    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Farewell, Mr. Rochester, for the present.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Farewell, Miss Eyre, for the present; is that all?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Yes; I suppose you found that out by second-sight.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, sir, I shall be ready when the order to march comes.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Yes, sir, I will advertise immediately: and meantime, I suppose—",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Where do you see the necessity?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe she thought I had forgotten my station, and yours, sir.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, never mind that now,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, but what?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Very well, sir, I will try.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, I cannot return to the house,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Very well, sir.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe I am.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
