    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, sir?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You see now how the case stands—do you not?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Farewell, kind Mrs. Fairfax!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Farewell, my darling Adèle!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "My sisters, you see, have a pleasure in keeping you,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe you will accept the post I offer you,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, if you are not ambitious, you are—",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "It is what I mean to do,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Quite well,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Very well,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I suppose not.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, what did he want?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps you have read the figures wrong—it may be two thousand!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "And the school, Miss Eyre? It must now be shut up, I suppose?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I mean, on the contrary, to be busy.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You see, Jane, the battle is fought and the victory won.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "And I am so plain, you see, Die. We should never suit.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "What have you heard? What do you see?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I mean the present gentleman, Mr. Edward’s father,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "No—perhaps it would have been better if there had.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, sir, I will stay with you: I have said so.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "And you see the candles?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Can you see me?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, whatever my sufferings had been, they were very short,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps you would rather not sit any longer on my knee, Miss Eyre?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, you can leave me, ma’am: but before you go",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Have you, Miss? Well, for sure!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "Well, and what of John Reed?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "Well, and you want your fortune told?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "I was speaking of myself.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "What a dreadful noise! it went quite through me!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "This is the state of things I quite approve,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Not at all, Bessie; indeed, just now I’m rather sorry.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Is there a little girl called Jane Eyre here?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "A little, ma’am.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I come from a place farther north, quite on the borders of Scotland.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Not quite so much, I think, ma’am.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "It is a little better.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "you’ve not quite forgotten me, I think, Miss Jane?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "A little.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "What did you say, my dear? I am a little deaf,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Is Mr. Rochester an exacting, fastidious sort of man?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Oh, quite well! I never felt better.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "And Miss Ingram: what sort of a voice had she?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Oh, what a little puppet!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Then, what induced you to take charge of such a little doll as that?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Humph! Not exactly. Your witch’s skill is rather at fault sometimes.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Then you and I must bid good-bye for a little while?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Good! but not quite the thing,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I would far rather she went, sir.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "No: I would rather be excused.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "The ceremony is quite broken off,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "rather snappish, but not ’rageous.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Yes, sir; for hours if you will.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Yes; two or three. Quite as many as there was employment for.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "My strength is quite failing me,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "A little more, St. John—look at the avidity in her eyes.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "You are quite right, I am sure,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Quite well,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Leave your book a moment, and come a little nearer the fire,",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Yes, you, rich—quite an heiress.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I would rather not just now.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "I would rather Diana or Mary informed you.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Have you any sort of conveyance?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "quite a desolate spot.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "Perhaps you would rather not sit any longer on my knee, Miss Eyre?",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hedge",
    "pattern": "A little Hindostanee.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "self_interruption",
    "pattern": "I intended to have arranged them, but I forgot.",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "self_interruption",
    "pattern": "I forgot!",
    "source_book": "1260",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But perhaps you would like to read it",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "_You_ began the evening well, Charlotte,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe, ma’am, I may safely promise you _never_ to dance with him.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "It may, perhaps, be pleasant,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You saw me dance at Meryton, I believe, sir.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, my dear,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "You allude, perhaps, to the entail of this estate.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I know very well, madam,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I believe her to be both in a great degree,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I dare say you will find him very agreeable.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "She is a very good kind of girl, I believe. I know no harm of her.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "but perhaps, to the Lakes.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "He likes to have his own way very well,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, Lizzy,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps we might be deceived.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But perhaps he may be a little whimsical in his civilities,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "But you see that Jane,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "No, I believe not.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps it would have been better,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "He meant, I believe,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, well,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, and what news does it bring--good or bad?",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "but perhaps you would like to read it.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Well, mamma,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Perhaps preparing for his marriage with Miss de Bourgh,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "I dare say she will; she has got over the most trying age.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "Oh, Lord! I don’t know. Not these two or three years, perhaps.",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "hesitation",
    "pattern": "This is the consequence, you see, madam, of marrying a daughter,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
