    "pattern": "We were talking of music, madam,",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "Well, and what news does it bring--good or bad?",
    "source_book": "1342",
    "style_pattern": "style"
  },
  {
    "kind": "topic_shift",
    "pattern": "Well, well, and so Mr. Bingley is coming down, sister,",
